        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::006::a49051cd3f"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stationary friction processing at high rotational speed can be used to enhance the alloy's oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::006::a49051cd3f"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher SFP rotational speed produces greater grain refinement and higher strain rates than lower rotational speed.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::006::a49051cd3f"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant oxidation conditions are laboratory air at 850–1050 °C for 100 h.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "SFP-processed AlCoCrFeNi develops a dense, well-adherent, layered oxide scale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The layered oxide scale consists of an outer chromia layer and an inner alumina layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The dense layered scale acts as a barrier to continued oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Barrier formation by the dense layered scale provides high oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-speed SFP provides greater oxidation-resistance improvement than low-speed SFP.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::006::a49051cd3f"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast AlCoCrFeNi alloy is the baseline.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy forms cracked, non-adherent mixed oxide layers rather than the protective scale found after processing.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism relies on high-angle grain boundaries.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective mechanism depends on the alloy's Al and Cr chemistry and the formation of alumina and chromia.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::005::513a1f22e3"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The exact roles of the alloy's other elements are not fully understood.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The effects of processing parameters beyond those examined on oxide-scale formation are not fully understood.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_mechanisms::006::a49051cd3f"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
